ightly believable.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span font-size:=\"\" open=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \" text-align:=\"\">All the Lorem Ipsum generators on the Internet tend to repeat predefined chunks as necessary, making this the first true generator on the Internet. It uses a dictionary of over 200 Latin words, combined with a handful of model sentence structures, to generate Lorem Ipsum which looks reasonable.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n', '2026-10-04'),
(2, 'Header-Contact', '<ul class=\"header-info\">\r\n	<li><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\"></i>\r\n	<h6><span>Address:</span>RP Renovations &amp; Custom Builds Inc.<br />\r\n	9 Frost Street Brampon On, L6X 595</h6>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li><i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt\"></i>\r\n	<h6><span>Call Anytime:</span> +1 647-702-0880</h6>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"social-icons\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rp_renovation.ca?stkn=MzNoYnR4MHk2Ymxq\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a></div>\r\n', '2026-10-05'),
(3, 'Home-Video', '<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"section-title\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center wow fadeInUp\">Watch Our Videos</h2>\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"video-inner wow zoomIn\"><img alt=\"Video\" src=\"https://www.jquesttechnologies.ca/chromiumconstruction/assets/images/video-image.jpg\" /> <a class=\"video-play\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '2026-10-07'),
(4, 'Home-About', '<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-7\">\r\n<div class=\"wp-images rmb-150 wow fadeInLeft\">\r\n<div class=\"experience-year\"><span class=\"number\">07</span>\r\n<h4>Years of Experience</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<img alt=\"About\" src=\"https://rprenovations.ca//assets/images/about2.jpg\" /> <img alt=\"About\" src=\"https://www.jquesttechnologies.ca/chromiumconstruction/assets/images/about2.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-5\">\r\n<div class=\"wp-content ml-50 rml-0 rpt-30\">\r\n<div class=\"section-title mb-10 wow fadeInRight\">\r\n<h6>RP Renovations &amp; Custom Builds Inc.</h6>\r\n\r\n<h2>A small efficient<br />\r\n<span>construction</span><br />\r\n<span class=\"thin\">renovation team</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h6>welcome to<br />\r\nRP Renovations &amp; Custom Builds Inc.</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.jquesttechnologies.ca/chromiumconstruction/assets/images/about.png\" /></div>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary btnfreesitevisit mt-4\" href=\"/contactus\">Request a Free, No Obligation Quote</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"position:fixed; top:40%; right:0px; z-index:99\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/16477020880\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://rprenovations.ca/assets/images/whatsapp.png\" style=\"width:40px; height:40px;\" /></a></div>\r\n', '2026-10-05'),
(5, 'Home-Counter', '<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"success-box\"><span class=\"count-text\" data-speed=\"5000\" data-stop=\"50000\">0</span>\r\n<div class=\"success-content\">\r\n<h3>Square Areas</h3>\r\n\r\n<h6>Complex</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--<div class=\"col-xl-3 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"success-box\"><span class=\"count-text\" data-speed=\"5000\" data-stop=\"97\">0</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"success-content\">\r\n<h3>Happy</h3>\r\n\r\n<h6>Clients</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>-->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"success-box\"><span class=\"count-text\" data-speed=\"5000\" data-stop=\"48\">0</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"success-content\">\r\n<h3>Completed</h3>\r\n\r\n<h6>Projects</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"success-box\"><span class=\"count-text\" data-speed=\"5000\" data-stop=\"40\">0</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"success-content\">\r\n<h3>Team</h3>\r\n\r\n<h6>Members</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '2023-05-18'),
(6, 'Footer-Contact', '<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<h6>We have a reliable team of engineers, architects and licensed technicians to meet your needs at one go!</h6>\r\n\r\n<h6>RP Renovations &amp; Custom Builds Inc.<br />\r\n9 Frost Street Brampon On, L6X 595<br />\r\n+1 647-702-0880</h6>\r\n\r\n<p><a class=\"btn btn-primary btnfreesitevisit\" href=\"/contactus\">Book a Free Site Visit</a></p>\r\n', '2026-10-05'),
(7, 'Footer-Content', '<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"bottom-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"social-icons\"><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rp_renovation.ca?stkn=MzNoYnR4MHk2Ymxq\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"copyright\">\r\n<p>&copy; Copyright 2026&nbsp;by <a href=\"\">RP Renovations &amp; Custom Builds Inc.</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '2026-10-07'),
(8, 'Contact Us', '<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"info-item wow zoomIn\"><img alt=\"Icon\" src=\"https://www.jquesttechnologies.ca/chromiumconstruction/assets/images/address.png\" />\r\n<p>RP Renovations &amp; Custom Builds Inc.<br />\r\n9 Frost Street Brampon On, L6X 595</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"info-item  wow zoomIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.6s\"><img alt=\"Icon\" src=\"https://www.jquesttechnologies.ca/chromiumconstruction/assets/images/email.png\" />\r\n<p>info@rprenovations.ca<br />\r\n+1 647-702-0880</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"info-item  wow zoomIn\" data-wow-delay=\"1.2s\"><img alt=\"Icon\" src=\"https://www.jquesttechnologies.ca/chromiumconstruction/assets/images/website.png\" />\r\n<p>Web Address:<br />\r\nrprenovations.ca</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '2026-08-22');
